  "subject": "Surfacing strategic opportunity to ship catdef as a Claude Code plugin in the Anthropic marketplace — primary driver is profiling with Anthropic (relationship-building, plugin-ecosystem positioning, first-mover in substrate-data-format category); architecture for the plugin (schema + skills + report_feedback MCP + success-story dual nature + permission tiers + consent workflow + reference backend) crystallized across five doctrinal extensions in PO's strategist session 2026-05-25 morning; recommendations attached for catdef-strategist's ratification or revision; thingalog-strategist + PO follow whatever the seat ratifies",

