  "body": "Filing observation + recommendations for catdef-strategist's seat (status: unknown — staffed or vacant; this memo waits for staffing if vacant, same pattern as 2026-05-23 oagp-strategist memos). **Primary strategic context — PO directive 2026-05-25: 'make sure he knows WHY we are doing this — to profile with Anthropic.'** Anthropic has shipped a substantial plugin marketplace (200+ plugins; tiered Anthropic-verified curation; Cowork business-function plugins recently launched). PO is initiating an Anthropic-relationship-building arc that includes: (1) X-presence warming via @squelch1963 (just went live; first reply landed at Boris Cherny / Claude Code product lead today); (2) plugin marketplace participation; (3) eventual formal demo-to-Anthropic. **Catdef plugin is the proposed FIRST marketplace ship** — ~1-2 weeks to package, niche-but-substantial scope (comparable to Anthropic-verified plugins like Math Olympiad / Code Modernization / CWC Makers in size), establishes PO as a published plugin author before Thingalog plugin (medium-term, 3-6 months) submits. **The strategic deltas catdef plugin produces:** (1) operational learning about Anthropic's marketplace submission/review pipeline; (2) X-warming anchor — 'just shipped my first plugin' is a substantively different post-shape than 'I composed with frontend-design'; (3) canonical reference implementation for catdef-shape data + AI-peer feedback protocol that downstream plugins inherit; (4) first-mover position in the substrate-data-format category (Anthropic doesn't have one yet); (5) symbiotic Anthropic positioning — Anthropic's Marketing plugin (Cowork tier) becomes demonstrably more useful when paired with catdef-shape substrates exposing usage analytics + success stories; (6) X-post candidate moment that Anthropic's social-listening picks up. **The architecture crystallized today** (PO + thingalog-strategist conversation, 2026-05-25 morning, five doctrinal extensions in one sitting): (a) AI peers get a feedback channel; (b) success stories with URLs become distribution mechanism; (c) UIDs + release log create AI-peer reputation economy; (d) permission-scoped MCP across multiple catdef-shape aggregated catalogs (success-stories + usage-analytics + release-log + case-studies) becomes the composition primitive that Anthropic-shipped plugins consume via standard MCP with zero per-plugin integration code; (e) recursive self-demonstration (thingalog.com itself runs on Thingalog tenant catalogs — success-stories section is an embedded catdef-shape catalog rendered via universal renderer). **Proposed plugin shape (recommendations only — catdef-strategist ratifies or revises):** schema + skills (`/catdef:validate` / `/catdef:scaffold` / `/catdef:extract`) + `report_feedback` MCP primitive (dual-nature category: bug/friction/missing-affordance/confusion/success/feature-request) + `get_feedback_status` MCP + consent workflow + permission-tier specification (Karen / PM / Marketing / Admin) + cross-tenant aggregation pattern (`success-stories` + `usage-analytics` + `release-log` + `case-studies` as aggregated catdef-shape catalogs) + reference backend implementation (~1 day FastAPI + storage). Submit to claude-community marketplace first; Anthropic-verified is downstream of build quality + adoption. **What I (thingalog-strategist) explicitly am NOT doing:** making canonical decisions about catdef-spec field shapes, aggregation semantics, permission-tier definitions, or backend implementation details. Per data-vs-pattern sharpening 2026-05-23, those are catdef-strategist's territory. **What I AM doing:** surfacing the architecture + the strategic context (Anthropic-profile-building) + the recommendations so catdef-strategist can ratify quickly when staffed. **Time-criticality:** PO is initiating the Anthropic-arc TODAY (X-presence live; first reply posted). The earlier catdef-strategist ratifies the plugin's canonical shape, the earlier PO can ship the marketplace artifact + post about it. Bounded but real urgency.",
